  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently, Indirect Containers can be configured to update the SMTs of other resources...this should be prevented.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For example (and the following example can be reproduced with most, if not all, SMTs):",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Create a resource",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "> curl -i -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPUT ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/resource"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/resource",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Create an  Indirect Container:",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "> curl -i -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPUT ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/i"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/i",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": " -H \"Link: <",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#IndirectContainer"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#IndirectContainer",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": ">;rel=\\\"type\\\"\" ",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Add Indirect Container triples to the new container:",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "> curl -i -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPATCH ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/i"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/i",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": " -H \"Content-Type: application/sparql-update\" --data-binary @danger.su",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "...where danger.su is:",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "```",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "INSERT { ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": " <> <",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#membershipResource"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#membershipResource",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": "> </rest/resource> ;",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "  <",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#hasMemberRelation"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#hasMemberRelation",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": "> <",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#createdBy"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#createdBy",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": "> ;",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "  <",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#insertedContentRelation"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#insertedContentRelation",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": "> <",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://www.openarchives.org/ore/terms/proxyFor"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://www.openarchives.org/ore/terms/proxyFor",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": ">",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "}",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "WHERE {}",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "```",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "The above PATCH should fail because \"ldp:hasMemberRelation\" is set to an SMT (\"fedora:createdBy\" in this case)",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Add a child to the Indirect Container",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "> curl -i -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPUT -H\"Content-Type: text/turtle\" --data-binary @proxy.ttl localhost:8080/rest/i/child",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "...where proxy.ttl is:",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "```",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "<> <",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "http://www.openarchives.org/ore/terms/proxyFor"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "http://www.openarchives.org/ore/terms/proxyFor",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": "> \"Andrew Woods\" .",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "```",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In the current broken state, you will see that a new `fedora:createdBy` triple has been added to /rest/resource (BAD)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
